                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "0d21e9e2-6776-4f53-9916-c318050bfb91",
                        "entry_id": "8f79c650-f2c8-3a10-8e89-73ff857b4b03",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "гламу́рна"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1c5f9b8a-1d2f-4a34-85e2-3e9500d9293a",
                        "entry_id": "8f79c650-f2c8-3a10-8e89-73ff857b4b03",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "гламу́рны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c1221cc-f67f-386a-9125-201db25f1305",
                        "entry_id": "8f79c650-f2c8-3a10-8e89-73ff857b4b03",
                        "glosses": [
                            "вычурный, модный, роскошный; яркий, пёстрый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6990daed-8462-4cbe-8fc8-16d6f9148117",
                                "sense_id": "7c1221cc-f67f-386a-9125-201db25f1305",
                                "text": "Но, учитывая его колоссальные возможности — от раскручивания всяких заблуждений до психологических консультаций в гламурных журналах, — можно предполагать многое."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba6f1b30-27af-4167-98f8-7c7fdd54daaf",
                                "sense_id": "7c1221cc-f67f-386a-9125-201db25f1305",
                                "text": "Самая гламурная, самая легковесная, самая девичья команда последнего времени (в том смысле, что «всем девчонкам нравится») — наконец-то в Москве."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62a87fba-39b8-49c3-87d2-3b11a4f7da76",
                                "sense_id": "7c1221cc-f67f-386a-9125-201db25f1305",
                                "text": "Если у меня сегодня гламурное настроение, то я надену что-нибудь пурпурное, а если завтра я чувствую себя бизнес-вумен, то выйду из дома в чёрном деловом костюме."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91a0678e-d776-4f0b-ac5d-a8be71c434f0",
                                "sense_id": "7c1221cc-f67f-386a-9125-201db25f1305",
                                "text": "Настоящая гламурная девушка всегда свежа, ухоженна, у нее нет синяков под глазами, она занимается фитнессом."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9401d1d-e54a-4e8f-9191-c281aa31d81f",
                                "sense_id": "7c1221cc-f67f-386a-9125-201db25f1305",
                                "text": "Новый год требует гламурного блеска и роскоши, пусть даже театральной."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "74ae9974-4320-3425-8041-55e4d53512df",
                        "entry_id": "8f79c650-f2c8-3a10-8e89-73ff857b4b03",
                        "glosses": [
                            "относящийся к гламуру, предназначенный для осуществления гламура, содержащий гламур"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "313d0c3f-8b90-487d-ae07-4eef8de0bd4d",
                                "sense_id": "74ae9974-4320-3425-8041-55e4d53512df",
                                "text": "Место: Развлекательный комплекс «Persna-Grata» (гламурный и негламурный танцполы, ресторан, суши-бар, бильярд, кальянный чиллаут)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "18e0f51b-4932-44de-ae1f-3db030318850",
                                "sense_id": "74ae9974-4320-3425-8041-55e4d53512df",
                                "text": "Хотя в дом к Рабанну попасть трудно. Никаких гламурных фотосессий. Он оберегает свою жизнь от вульгарных вторжений."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "95b2ef5a-fd81-4f2e-ab23-3a614562c9ef",
                                "sense_id": "74ae9974-4320-3425-8041-55e4d53512df",
                                "text": "Это сборник лучших хитов самых значимых артистов яркой и гламурной (с высоты прошедших двух десятилетий) эпохи 80-х."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e30dc6e-e29c-47d8-8344-ea6d1090a553",
                        "source_entry_id": "8f79c650-f2c8-3a10-8e89-73ff857b4b03",
                        "target_lang_word": "glitzy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "glitzy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "beb22541-c88b-35b2-849a-8f200889fe6a",
                                        "entry_id": "7d8b0d13-3756-303f-9d79-82b0323f65fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Brilliantly showy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78ae8c17-43a1-4318-bcf8-fe782503b343",
                                                "sense_id": "beb22541-c88b-35b2-849a-8f200889fe6a",
                                                "text": "It must have been a while since I've attended a fancy, glitzy event, because as soon as I got to the GQ awards I felt like something was up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "34fb62bb-e185-4efa-a1f8-f0f30e8f3403",
                        "source_entry_id": "8f79c650-f2c8-3a10-8e89-73ff857b4b03",
                        "target_lang_word": "flashy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flashy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6408e24e-eafe-397c-bf38-1df809b3a9bd",
                                        "entry_id": "b5703697-c93f-3949-9b07-780801db2476",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Showy; visually impressive, attention-getting, or appealing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a01a4c06-964c-4beb-8602-fa825c580624",
                                                "sense_id": "6408e24e-eafe-397c-bf38-1df809b3a9bd",
                                                "text": "The dancers wore flashy costumes featuring shiny sequins in many vibrant colors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b94c963d-815e-3c91-8d3f-37efa7d9cd03",
                                        "entry_id": "b5703697-c93f-3949-9b07-780801db2476",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marked by frequent variations in water amount (compare flash flood)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a river"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de7a60a6-8638-42d9-ae00-d003c733d338",
                                                "sense_id": "b94c963d-815e-3c91-8d3f-37efa7d9cd03",
                                                "text": "Flow criteria were used for classification […] The criteria chosen were […] (4) the rate of change of flow with time (logged serial correlation coefficients are 0.2 in flashy rivers, but up to 0.98 in stable ones); and (5) the velocity associated with average daily flows (this varies from 1.03 m/s in flashy rivers to 0.08 m/s in lowland ones)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7785898d-e806-3ecd-b3b2-cf90e94c6efc",
                                        "entry_id": "b5703697-c93f-3949-9b07-780801db2476",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Flashing; producing flashes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94e35ed5-def8-45e9-963c-ba7f8d958256",
                                                "sense_id": "7785898d-e806-3ecd-b3b2-cf90e94c6efc",
                                                "text": "a flashy light"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e672896-0975-4563-9ddb-bb2f6cd17f69",
                                                "sense_id": "7785898d-e806-3ecd-b3b2-cf90e94c6efc",
                                                "text": "[…] the accustomed warmth pierced his marrow, and ran thrilling through his shaken bones; just as when at times, with forked thunder burst, a chinky stream of fire in flashy lightning shoots athwart the skies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00530cec-32bc-384b-96db-cc4ce0836613",
                                        "entry_id": "b5703697-c93f-3949-9b07-780801db2476",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Drunk; tipsy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0eecaa3e-d9ff-405a-bc18-3f8116dd7dcb",
                                                "sense_id": "00530cec-32bc-384b-96db-cc4ce0836613",
                                                "text": "Indeed, he was 'dithguthted' at his condition; and if upon the occasion just described he had allowed himself to be somewhat 'intoxicated with liquor,' I must aver that I do not recollect another instance in which this worthy little gentleman suffered himself to be similarly overtaken. Now and then a little 'flashy' he might be, but nothing more serious—and rely upon it, this was no common virtue in those days."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
